00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:19.180
- Yeah, so if you wanna
switch to this, you can.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:20.014
It's a little bit thick.

00:02:20.014 --> 00:02:22.225
You're gonna have to
put some muscle into it.

00:02:22.225 --> 00:02:23.643
