- You're an old pro. Look at that.

00:02:34.404 --> 00:02:36.865
Alright, so you're gonna add the eggs.

00:02:36.865 --> 00:02:38.783
- In you go, eggs.

00:02:38.783 --> 00:02:40.451
- Yeah.
- Oh, my God.

00:02:40.451 --> 00:02:41.870
