00:02:46.457 --> 00:02:47.625
- Here, can I show you a little trick?

00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:48.459
- Yeah.

00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:51.171
- Sometimes, this is called
folding if you scrape like this,

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:52.881
