a little bit at a time.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:09.564
Perfect.

00:03:09.564 --> 00:03:10.398
- Keep mixing.

00:03:10.398 --> 00:03:11.232
- Yeah, keep mixing.

00:03:11.232 --> 00:03:13.943
